<section class="sp-section sp-section--paper"><div class="sp-shell sp-flash-feature sp-roulette-panel"><div class="sp-flash-copy"><p class="sp-eyebrow">LEAVE A LITTLE ROOM FOR SURPRISE</p><h2>LET CHANCE<br>START THE<br>CONVERSATION.</h2><p>The studio's Ink Roulette experience includes two spins for $150. Choose a number from your spins and a design from the board. Prefer another number? The published option is an additional $20.</p><p>For a little inspiration before your visit, shuffle through the studio's Ink Roulette designs below. This gallery shuffle does not make an official Ink Roulette selection or reserve an appointment.</p><button class="sp-button sp-button--red" type="button" data-spin>Shuffle the inspiration <span aria-hidden="true">↻</span></button><p><output data-spin-result aria-live="polite">Explore a design, then talk to an artist.</output></p><a class="sp-link" href="/pages/contact">Ask about Ink Roulette <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="sp-roulette-image"><img src="{{ 'sp-roulette-01.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="An Ink Roulette design from Sideshow Productions" width="800" height="1000" loading="lazy"></div><script type="application/json" data-flash-pool>[{% for block in section.blocks %}{"image":{{ block.settings.asset | asset_url | json }},"title":{{ block.settings.title | json }}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{% endfor %}]</script></div></section>
